// Keeps the rev-647 HP orb coherent when the Constitution skill level changes.
//
// In the 2011 (Constitution) model, current life points live in varbit
// life_points (7198) as a granular pool (0..max), driven by combat damage
// (engine) and the [timer,health_regen] timer. Max is derived client-side from
// the Hitpoints skill level x10. This trigger fires when that skill level
// changes (level-up / boost / drain); it only clamps current life points DOWN
// to the new max, so a level-up never reduces current HP, and damage (which
// does NOT fire this) never snaps the orb back to full.
[changestat,hitpoints]
def_int $max = calc(stat(hitpoints) * 10);
if (%life_points > $max) {
    %life_points = $max;
}
